  "notes": "Fourth quadruple at n=89 with the same fixed skew first block as n89-eec2e43c042090883c04, n89-b2a223b0fb7500feb95f and n89-f41d2ad6797d337bba02, reported on 2026-11-22 by the same further round of the three-pool join over the cyclic group Z_89 that gave the third. The other three blocks differ from those of the earlier quadruples and have no symmetry. This is a sample and not a census. The Goethals-Seidel matrix of these rows is a skew-Hadamard matrix of order 356."
